## Documentation

### When to Comment
✅ Complex algorithms, non-obvious logic, public APIs, key decisions
❌ Obvious code, bad variable names, instead of refactoring

### JavaDoc
```apex
/**
 * Description
 * @param name Description
 * @return Description
 * @throws Type When/why
 */
```

---

## Deployment

**Checklist:**
- [ ] Tests pass (100%)
- [ ] Coverage ≥ 75%
- [ ] No linter errors
- [ ] Formatted
- [ ] Tested in sandbox

---

## Commit Format

```
type(scope): description

feat: New feature
fix: Bug fix
docs: Documentation
test: Tests
refactor: Code change
```

